    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d607-a1">

                <pb facs="0771" n="659" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg659"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Mexican Acting Secretary of State for Foreign
                        Affairs</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Pérez</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the American
                        Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Fletcher</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 3785</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-11-07">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 7, 1918</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ambassador</hi>: In relation to my former note
                    No. 3419 of the 8th instant [<hi rendition="#italic">sic</hi>], regarding the
                    laws of payments of December 24, 1917, and April 13 of this year, which annul in
                    part the moratorium governing the payment of money obligations, I have the honor
                    to state to your excellency that the Department of the Treasury has forwarded to
                    me, in the nature of a report, a memorandum <pb facs="0772" n="660"
                        xml:id="pg660"/> and chart regarding’ the fluctuations of paper money, to
                    which reference is made in the memorandum, of which I beg to attach a copy.</p>
                <p>I avail [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Garza Pérez</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
